## Summary

Implemented **`DET.DIAGRAM.ASSET_REGISTRY`** so diagram catalog keys and shipped `assets/svg/` paths align with active **`diagram-family`** / **`diagram-asset-group`** rows in `visual-registry.generated.json`.

### Rule signals (from `deterministic-design-rules.md`)

| Signal | Check |
|--------|--------|
| Registry | Active `diagram-family` row exists |
| Repo | Every `js/ks-diagram-catalog.js` key maps to `_diagram_gallery.py` → `template-*.svg` |
| Repo | Every gallery template path appears in registry `source_paths` |
| DOM (crawl) | `data-diagram-key` values are in the KS catalog (repo or `__FORGE_KS_DIAGRAM_CATALOG`) |
| DOM | Diagram `img[src]` under `assets/svg/` is covered by registry paths when `--repo` is set |

### Files changed

1. **`design-rules/deterministic/generated/det-diagram-asset-registry.check.js`** — Full check with `scanRepoDiagramAssetRegistry`, `collectDiagramAssetRegistryReport` (Playwright), `findingsFromDiagramAssetRegistryReport`, and `run()`.
2. **`design-rules/blender/rule-mappings.js`** — Registered under `DETERMINISTIC_IMPLEMENTATIONS` as `implemented` (`visual-catalog` / `visualCatalogGovernance` / `warn` / weight `7`).
3. **`design-rules/registry.generated.json`** — Rule marked `implemented` (re-run `npm run blend-rules` to refresh fingerprint/timestamp).
4. **`auditor-tests/det-diagram-asset-registry.test.js`** — Unit tests for parsers, repo scan, DOM analysis, and findings shape.

